  "notes": "Boot t2_l8 from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open (public 22 released) and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled. Leave the fresh-NVRAM loop with Escape, step past the TEST REPORT and game identification, open the T. TESTS menu, start T.4 SOLENOID TEST (repeat mode, solenoid 01) and step it with Up through solenoid 14, then Escape, move to T.5 FLASHER TEST and step it through flashers 17-27 until it wraps back to 17. In repeat mode the ROM pulses the selected output continuously and prints its own name and wire colours for it, so every step pairs a printed name with the public address PinMAME publishes.",
